[CrDroid Android](http://crdroid.org/)
======================================

Download the Source
===================

Please read the [AOSP building instructions](http://source.android.com/source/index.html) before proceeding.

Initializing Repository
-----------------------

Repo initialization:

    $ repo init -u https://github.com/crdroid-classic/android.git -b 4.4 --git-lfs --depth=1


sync repo :

    $ repo sync -c -j$(nproc) --force-sync --no-clone-bundle --no-repo-verify --no-tags --optimized-fetch
